---
import Sheet from '../layouts/Sheet.astro';
---

<Sheet
  title="Privacy Policy | Lombard Belz"
  description="Lombard Belz keeps only what you email us, sells no data, and sets no tracking cookies. The full policy, in plain language."
  path="/privacy/"
  sheetName="Privacy"
>
  <section class="section privacy">
    <div class="container privacy__inner">
      <p class="tag">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The short version: this site collects nothing on its own and sets
        no tracking cookies. If you email us, we keep what you sent so we
        can reply.
      </p>

      <div class="privacy__body">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          If you email us, we receive what you send: your name, your email
          address, and your message. The site itself collects nothing about
          you.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use it to reply to you and to carry on the conversation you
          started. We do not add you to a mailing list, share your
          information, or sell it to anyone.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          This site sets no cookies and runs no tracking or analytics
          scripts. If we ever add analytics, it will be a cookieless,
          server-side kind that does not identify you, and this policy will
          say so before it happens.
        </p>

        <h2>Where your email lives</h2>
        <p>
          Email to us sits in our mailbox like any other correspondence. The
          site is hosted on Netlify, which keeps standard server logs on our
          behalf.
        </p>

        <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
        <p>
          Lombard Belz is an assumed name of SkyKPI LLC, an Illinois limited
          liability company based in Frankfort, Illinois. Any reference to
          Lombard Belz in this policy means SkyKPI LLC.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          If you want a copy of what you sent us, or want it deleted, email
          <a href="mailto:hello@lombardbelz.com">hello@lombardbelz.com</a> and we will
          take care of it.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy__issued meta">Last updated 2026.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Sheet>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding-top: var(--space-section);
  }

  .privacy__inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .privacy__body {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .privacy__body h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 2.25rem 0 0.6rem;
  }

  .privacy__body a {
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .privacy__issued {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
</style>
